+Keep one authoritative board per event. Editors submit commands over HTTPS; browsers display a revisioned view of the board. Committed changes are delivered to browsers via self-hosted WebSockets. Subsecond updates are the target; 15-second freshness under normal connectivity remains the hard requirement.
 
